        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage FC172LAT-KIN, Dummy Pair Latitude Lever with Kinsler Trim</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe modern looking Latitude Lever with Kinsler Rose Non Turning Dummy Lock is for use on doors that do not need to be latched or locked. A dummy pair, it comes packaged with 2 levers and two rosettes but does not include a latch. For use on inactive doors in conjunction with a <a href=\"/products/latitude-lever-with-kinsler-trim-schlage-fc21lat-kin\"><b>hall-closet and bed-bath lock function Latitude Lever</b></a>. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Dummy Pair:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of the door. This leverset does not latch and does not lock.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Schlage Custom Latitude lever with Kinsler Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Will fit most standard pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>Surface mounted.</li>\r\n<li>Lock and finish backed by limited lifetime warranty </li>\r\n<li>Installs in minutes with screwdriver.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Dummy Set Latitude Lever with Kinsler Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4.4375\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2.375\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li>Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
